ges over time.\n(Create a scene in which the mass decreases over time from the initial mass to 0 g.) \nWhy does the mass decrease? \nBecause the liquid acetone particles on the surface of the acetone become a gas and evaporate into the air.\n5. (Result) As the acetone dries, the scale on the electronic balance gets smaller and smaller until it reaches zero.", "short_description": "Experience the fascinating process of evaporation with the acetone evaporation experiment. It's a simple yet intriguing demonstration of how substances change from liquid to gas, providing a clear insight into the principles of physical changes and vapor pressure."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/privacy-policy-en/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/terms-and-conditions-en/", "publisher_name": "ContentsDa Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ko"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25661389260185402"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974714_919806603134811_5947713398043604070_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sj64mas7DPYQ7kNvwGD8Ttm&_nc_oc=Adm9TsBQVVYbbhVUMG1meGGshu-PeuhMwHRhS9s_JJV3SQMhRWzrc9Z7lmsWWRy6BUo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3